     "body": "<p>What would be most interesting to me are resources that failed to load correctly and why.  If something fails, I would try to fix that record and start over.  Successfully loaded records don't mean much to me, in this context, but I could see how some might find them useful.  Especially if the format allowed for comparing this log to the log generated on export.  </p>\n\n<p>And the overall number imported would be handy to have for a quick sanity check, so long as the export log file has that as well. </p>",
     "created": "09/Sep/16 11:47 AM",
